# SMD can capacitor 0: a 4 x 4.5 mm SMD aluminium capacitor, 1 m across and 1.1 m tall (250 times life size): an olive can with a rounded top and a vent cross
# groove (pc_olive) on a black square base (pc_epoxy_black). Knee cover: convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

# A rounded can on a base, the vent cross cut into the top
Detail detail=0.45
    Union
        Material material=pc_olive
            Subtraction
                Translate translation=(0, 0.675, 0)
                    Round radius=0.15
                        CappedCylinder radius=0.35 height=0.275
                Union
                    Translate translation=(0, 1.1, 0)
                        Box size=(0.3, 0.04, 0.04)
                    Translate translation=(0, 1.1, 0)
                        Box size=(0.04, 0.04, 0.3)
        Material material=pc_epoxy_black
            Translate translation=(0, 0.15, 0)
                RoundBox size=(0.5, 0.15, 0.5) roundness=0.1
